Grok Bot just deleted my bot template?? 

I made a bot that helps you port over all your context from Grok Bot onto other AI platforms, and a week later I can't access it anymore. 

@poteto do templates expire? Because I can't find that info anywhere. https://t.co/FjMlZXaCcJ

@spacexai @xai Y'all need to normy-ize. I had to setup an old laptop and a NAS to give GrokBot a place to live on my network. 

Meta made a USB dongle. Google already had smart speakers. 

You should sell a box with Wifi/BT, USB, and networking, and you should sell smart https://t.co/gVyea5k1uC

@zeChedli GrokBot + Openbot with OpenRouter ($10 one time)

I went one step ahead and connected my grok bot with OpenBot to increase output by 2x. Enabled Alexandria protocol using FireCrawl to let them access the internet without a browser. 

DM me for details.

@norbertbodziony 我是从 grokbot 转向 openbot 的用户。openbot 各方面体验极佳，唯独网络延迟非常高，在无法打洞的情况下几乎不可用。

我有一台 mac mini 跑着 openbot，在局域网内没问题，一旦离开了局域网，就基本上无法使用了。

我对此做过一些调查，分析就是流量都从澳洲 tun 服务器中转了一圈，延迟非常高。
